  heroes  tui.diff, tui.format_changes
  go      bubbletea's renderer (its frames are strings, diffed by line, none of it public)
  rust    Buffer::diff, Buffer::diff_iter, ratatui::buffer::BufferDiff, ratatui::buffer::CellDiffOption, Terminal::flush, Backend::draw
  python  textual's compositor (none of it public)
