capability tui/paragraph  text drawn, wrapped between words or cut, and scrolled
  heroes  tui.Paragraph, tui.new_paragraph, tui.draw_paragraph, tui.height_of
  go      tview.TextView, tview.NewTextView, tview.TextView.SetText, tview.TextView.GetText, tview.TextView.SetWrap, tview.TextView.SetWordWrap, tview.TextView.ScrollTo, tview.TextView.ScrollToBeginning, tview.TextView.ScrollToEnd, tview.TextView.GetScrollOffset, tview.TextView.SetScrollable, tview.TextView.SetMaxLines, tview.TextView.GetOriginalLineCount, tview.TextView.GetWrappedLineCount, tview.TextView.Write, tview.TextView.BatchWriter, tview.TextView.Clear, tview.TextViewWriter, tview.WordWrap
