  note    `ratatui`'s answers on the selection kept in view, the padding, the room for the symbol, the items from the bottom, and only the items that fit whole drawn (the first shown cut where it is taller than the area); `new_list` highlights reversed where `ratatui`'s default highlights nothing. `tview`'s secondary text is a second line of an item, and its wrap-around a `move_selection` the program wraps

