  rust    ratatui::widgets::Gauge, Gauge::ratio, Gauge::percent, Gauge::label, Gauge::style, Gauge::gauge_style, Gauge::use_unicode
  python  textual.widgets.ProgressBar
  note    `ratatui`'s answers on the bar, the eighths and the label's swapped colours; where the bar runs under the cell after the label, `ratatui` left that cell blank (0.7 in 10 cells, a full gauge, 0.96 with no label), and this package fills it. A percentage is a ratio of a hundredth

